            "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
            "content_position": "md:place-self-start-end",
            "title": "<em><strong>Coconut Fiber</strong></em>",
            "content": "<p>Coconut fiber is a byproduct of the coconut industry, usually discarded as waste. </p><p>However, with a touch of creativity, it can be transformed into a sustainable fashion accessory. These upcycled shirt collar extenders for men's and women's shirts are crafted from coconut fiber that has been repurposed and given a new life.</p>",
            "indent_heading": false
          }
        }
